Package: RDCOMClient
Version: 0.96-2
Date: 2026-11-10
Title: R-DCOM client
Author: Duncan Temple Lang <duncan@r-project.org> [aut],
    Christian <christian.turner.bridger@gmail.com> [ctb]
Maintainer: Christian <christian.turner.bridger@gmail.com>
Contributions: Jo Totland (https://github.com/jototland)
Description: Provides dynamic client-side access to (D)COM applications from within R.
    Maintained public fork updated for R 4.6.x on Windows (Rtools 4.5 / GCC 14),
    including UTF-8 string conversion, SAFEARRAY and VARIANT_BOOL fixes,
    COM reference-counting repairs, and GC-safe finalizers.
License: GPL-2
LazyLoad: yes
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: methods
